one","row_content":"<p>The walker features a <strong>dual-action braking system<\/strong>. Simply pull the hand levers up to slow down while walking, or push them down until they click to lock the rear wheels for safe seating.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_nUJ4wq":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How long is the warranty?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>We provide a 1-year guarantee on all our walkers against manufacturing defects. This means that if any part of the walker fails due to faulty materials or workmanship within the first year, we will repair or replace it, giving you peace of mind with your purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_fqq6EW":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What is the maximum weight capacity?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>The reinforced steel and ABS frame is built for durability and can safely support a maximum load capacity of <strong>300 lb<\/strong>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_PMTJwB":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is assembly required when I receive the walker?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>The walker comes mostly pre-assembled, so setup is minimal and can usually be done in just a few minutes. Customers do not require tools, and the included instructions are clear and easy to follow. You’ll be ready to use your rollator right away.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_UWnNW8":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What if I have an issue with the walker after purchase?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>We stand by the quality of our rollator and offer a <strong>1-year guarantee<\/strong> against manufacturing defects. If any part fails due to faulty materials or workmanship, we will repair or replace it at no cost. Additionally, our <strong>30-day return policy<\/strong> ensures you can return or exchange the walker if it doesn’t meet your expectations.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_RBBixN","collapsible_row_trrN69","collapsible_row_F4AfYd","collapsible_row_nUJ4wq","collapsible_row_fqq6EW","collapsible_row_PMTJwB","collapsible_row_UWnNW8"],"name":"t:sections.collapsible_content.presets.name","settings":{"caption":"","heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","heading_size":"h1","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"section","color_scheme":"background-1","container_color_scheme":"scheme-ad51283d-6044-441e-b8ec-b4441c2da21b","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","heading_size_row":"h3","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":36}},"related-products":{"type":"related-products","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"You may also like","heading_size":"h2","collection_text_alignment":"left","products_to_show":4,"columns_desktop":4,"color_scheme":"background-1","image_ratio":"square","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"enable_quick_desc":false,"quick_desc_legth":90,"quick_desc_size":13,"columns_mobile":"2","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":28}},"rich_text_hGAkMi":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_eqQMjH":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"What Our Customers Are Saying","heading_size":"h1"}}},"block_order":["heading_eqQMjH"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"desktop_content_position":"left","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"scheme-ad51283d-6044-441e-b8ec-b4441c2da21b","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":44}},"1750173053466f69ca":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"judge_me_reviews_review_widget_acbtyh":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/review_widget\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","settings":{"review_data":"real_data","max_width":1200,"show_shop_reviews":false,"empty_state":"hide_widget"}}},"block_order":["judge_me_reviews_review_widget_acbtyh"],"settings":{"include_margins":true}},"1766872918f7b022d0":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"judge_me_reviews_medals_HFnT6g":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/medals\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","